<title>USA: Oakland, Calif., GOs won by BancAmerica.</title>
<headline>Oakland, Calif., GOs won by BancAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Securities said Wednesday it won $45.4 million Oakland, Calif., general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 5.6503 percent.</p>
</text>
